4.6. Student registration — Step 5: Academic Preferences

Ask questions that help personalize opportunity discovery.

Fields:

* Preferred study format: Online / Offline / Both.
* Preferred opportunity location: Local / International / Both.
* Interested in scholarships? Yes / No / Not sure.
* Interested in exchange programs? Yes / No / Not sure.
* Interested in research programs? Yes / No / Not sure.
